{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45212","headline":"同袁高使君送李判官使回 · 皎然","name":"同袁高使君送李判官使回","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庾公欢此别，路远意犹赊。\n爲出塘边柳，荣归府中花。\n驰阳照古堞，遥思凝寒笳。\n延步下前渚，泝觞流浅沙。\n湖光引行色，轻舸傍残霞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45212.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45212","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}